	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratissimum nobis est semperque fui ac erit etiam in posterum tua illa de omnibus, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quę scire nostra interest, scribendi diligentia, qua magna quidem tecum contentione <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>certarem, si ita nunc ferret ista mea solitudo, quę ab omni homi<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>num, qui rerum publicarum cognitionem habent, conversatione me abdit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Ab <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> nihil iam diu accepi, a cęteris <placeName ref="l2481">Svęvię</placeName> urbibus paulo forte plus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nihilo, adeo etiam literis viam obsepsit partim metus piorum, partim <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>impiorum insidiatrix illa et diligentissima observatio; quin etiam nunc a nostris <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pauca admodum de urbis statu in ista omnium rerum confusione et intemperie <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>accipio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nuper rursum <persName ref="p4672">Ecclius</persName> ille impetrata prius securitate salvi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>conductus apud nostros appulit, sed nihil attulit novi, nisi quod du<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>bitavit, verene diceretur vicinos quosdam in <placeName ref="l774">Turgoia</placeName>, baronem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l749">Saxum</placeName> vocans, tentare, ut, si Cęsariani aut regii unam, ipse aliam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>portam praevertens occupet.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Deinde dominum suum, qui se commissarium impe<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ratoris et regis nominavit, nondum peregre rediisse indicavit, ut <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>non potuerint declarari et planari quędam, quę prius senatus petierat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>De cęteris <placeName>Transrhenanis</placeName> nullum adhuc responsum allatum audio; put<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ant <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>autem prudentiores nonnulli monstri aliquid illos alere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hęrent igitur <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>mei illi (si tamen adhuc meos appellare fas est) inter sacrum et saxum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>plane, quod dicitur, lupum auribus tenentes, hoc est: stant inter Christum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et mundum, et utrinque ultro sibi periculum excitarunt et pro lupo nunc <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tenent asinum <foreign xml:lang="el">[griechisch]</foreign>; quem tametsi dimittere non erat <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>periculum, tenent tamen facilius, quod illi aures suppetent.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Fertur Cęsar petisisse a <persName ref="p1546">duce Christophoro</persName>, ut tradat <placeName>Montem <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Pelargi</placeName> aut <placeName>Peligardi</placeName>, pollicitus vicissim de patris ducatu quędam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Variant de multis multorum literę et rumores, ut pigeat ista ad te, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quę vulgo nullo fide digno authore iactitantur, perscribere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Man sagt, der kaiser ziech widerum heruff, den sun zum kaiser ze machen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>So hat ainer, so ouch zuͦ <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> gewesen, gesagt, papst und <persName ref="p8112">Frantzoß</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>habind ain pundtnusß wellen machen, habind in ainem articul <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nitt mögen uberainkommen, seyen allso zerschlagen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Item, der <persName ref="p8112">Frantzoß</persName>, so im pasß bewilliget worden von ettlichen Örtern, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>were wyllens gewessen, <placeName ref="l257">Costentz</placeName> inzenemmen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>item, papsts bottschafft habe an die vier evangelische Ort begert, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>das sy ouch in das concilium bewilligen wellen; werde inen <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>zuͦ vyl guͦtem fuͤrstendig sein, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>mitt fuͤrwendung, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>das der papst das Interims halber <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ganz ubel zuͦfriden seye, das im der kaiser in sein ampt gryffen hab.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Die copey, so ich vormals ann euch begert hab, ist von aim schriben, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>das mine herren thon habend an den <persName ref="p7492">von Furstenberg</persName>, darinn <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>er gebetten wirt um guͤtliche underhandlung, ussgangen 10. Augusti; <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ist derglichen ouch an <placeName ref="l1294">Wyngarten</placeName> usgangen; waist man nitt anderst, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>dann ewern herren sey ouch ain copey davon zuͦkommen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Wellt ich gern haben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ah mi venerande et charissime frater, ora pro me dominum, ut <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>me orantem pro sua benignitate exaudiat.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Supra modum magis <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>atque magis me conficit meorum illa plusquam miserrima miseria; <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>quamquam enim hęc levitas et oblivio plane letheo beneficiorum <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>dei valde quam abominabilis habenda est, tamen, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quoties adversarios et mundi vota circumspicio mecumque expendo, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>quod, quicquid accidit duri, evangelicę veritatis <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>caussa accidisse, dici non potest, quam misereat me gregis <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>non habentis aut contemnentis etiam pastorem, ut ausim <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>subinde verum ac vere bonum pastorem Christum precari, ut ipse <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>denuo curam suscipiat balantium, dum videlicet adhuc <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>illis agnosci potest magister atque huius vivificum pabulum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Precaberis igitur suplicibus votis mecum, ne dominus prorsus ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>huius curam abiiciat neu opportunis consiliis et auxiliis, quę <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>illi subeniant, tantopere conservatę desit.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale cum domo <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>tua, quam meis verbis diligenter et amanter saluta cum omnibus <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>fratribus et amicis, cum primis vero administros tuos in opere <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>domini, deinde <persName ref="p506">Butlerum</persName> et <persName ref="p1560">Hopperum</persName>, optimos et christianissimos viros, <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>cum quęstore <persName ref="p182">Arnoldo</persName> ac cęteris nostris.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvum te cupiunt mea <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>coniunx et germana soror.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Commendo tibi hunc adulescentem <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><persName ref="p8465">Melchiorem</persName> istic studiis operam daturum et apud <persName ref="p3988">Wolphium</persName> nostrum <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>cum aliis nostratibus commode, ni fallor, habiturum.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z23"/>Iterum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l184">Griessenbergi</placeName> 7. Octobris 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambr[osius] Bl[aurerus</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> et <persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName>, venerandos et charissimos <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>fratres ex me opido quam reverenter salutabis, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>quorum sacris precationibus domino semper commendari valde cupi<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z2"/>o.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Praestantiss[imo] pietate et <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>doctrina viro domino <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>amico velut fratri incomparabili, <lb xml:id="p4z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguricensis</placeName> ecclesię antistiti.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
